notes               = "Untitled in source. IMPORTANT — the ===lantern=== on this poem is BEN'S OWN pencil rendering from the margin of the printed page, dated 'SP 12 2020' (12 September 2020), not an agent's; his inconsistent spelling ('traveling' in line 1, 'travelling' in line 4) is reproduced as written. This follows the page-70 / stay-go precedent. With dew-deer (145, dated 2022) and tree-eyes (172, dated 2026) his marginal drafts in this stretch span three readings of the book six years apart. A few pencil letters ending '...ain' are cut off above the frame in the photograph and are not recoverable from it. Bare year ۱۳۷۷ → +621 = 1998. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
draft               = true

===persian===

در سفر
هرکس به مقصد می‌رسد
می‌ایستد...
من سفر را دوست دارم
مقصد من...
رفتن است...
تهران ۱۳۷۷

===machine===

On a journey
everyone reaches a destination
and stops...
I love the journey —
my destination...
is the going...
Tehran 1377

===lantern===

in traveling...
everyone arrives at a destination...
stops, stays...

I quite like travelling...
my destination...
is the going...

===translation===

